title: A Systematic Review of EC Number Prediction Algorithms Based on Reaction Chemical Structures
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of computational tools for enzyme function (EC number)
  prediction from reaction SMILES, spanning similarity-based and
  machine/deep learning approaches.
